{"strongs": "H2572", "word": "חֲמִשִּׁים", "translit": "cha.mish.shim", "root": "חמש", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "noun plural", "gloss": "fifty", "definition": "חֲמִשִּׁים 164 noun plural (a) fifty (Arabic Aramaic , Phoenician חמשם ; MI 28 חמשן ; Assyrian —amšâti Di in Lotz TP 80 ) — חֲמִשִּׁים Gen 6:15 + 154 t. (including Ezek 40:25 ; Ezek 40:29 ; Ezek 40:33 , strike out Co ) + Ezek 45:12 (so read A Hi Co for חמּשׁה ); suffix חֲמִשֶּׁיךָ 2Kgs 1:10 ; 2Kgs 1:12 , חֲמִשָּׁיו 2Kgs 1:9 + 4 t., חֲמִשֵּׁיהֶם 2Kgs 1:14 — 1. absolute \\ \\ a. a fifty , a company of fifty Exod 18:21 ; Exod 18:25 ; Deut 1:15 ; 1Sam 8:12 ; 2Kgs 1:9 (twice in verse) + 13 t. 2Kgs 1 (in v 2Kgs 1:14 = fifties ), Isa 3:3 . \\ \\ b. elsewhere, without noun expressed, (1) without other numeral Num 31:30 ; Num 31:47 ; Ezek 27:18 (twice in verse); Hag 2:16 (2) with other number ׳ ח preceding Exod 30:23 (twice in verse) + 11 t.; + 1Chr 12:34 Baer , van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:33 (followed by אלף ); (3) ׳ ח following Exod 38:26 + 10 t.; (4) ׳ ח between other number Num 1:23 + 23 t. 2. חֲמִשִּׁים without other number: \\ \\ a. before noun Gen 6:15 + 58 t. + בָּאַמָּה ׳ ח Exod 38:12 . \\ \\ b. after noun 2Sam 24:24 ; Exod 26:11 + 4 t. Chronicles 3. ׳ ח before other numbers: \\ \\ a. followed by noun Gen 7:24 +. \\ \\ b. preceded by noun 1Chr 5:21 . 4. ׳ ח after other number, and \\ \\ a. this after noun 1Chr 8:40 ; Ezra 8:3 ; Ezra 8:26 . \\ \\ b. noun repeated e.g. Gen 9:28 ; Gen 9:29 . 5. ׳ ח preceded by construct e.g. שָׁנָה ׳ בִּשְׁנַת ח 2Kgs 15:23 ; 2Kgs 15:27 ; Lev 15:10 ; Lev 15:11 . 6. ׳ ח = ordinal, fiftieth Lev 25:10 ; Lev 25:11 ; 2Kgs 15:23 , compare v 2Kgs 15:27 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2903')\">BDB2903</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2572')\">H2572</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2902')\">BDB2902</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2904')\">BDB2904</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֲמִשִּׁים</bdbheb><sub>164</sub> <b>noun plural</b> (a) <highlightword>fifty</highlightword> (Arabic <placeholder1833/> Aramaic <placeholder1834/>, Phoenician <bdbheb>חמשם</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MI')\"><reflink>MI</reflink><sup>28</sup></lookup> <bdbheb>חמשן</bdbheb>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>—amšâti</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> in Lotz<sup>TP 80</sup>) — <bdbheb>חֲמִשִּׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 6:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,6,15)\">Gen 6:15</ref> + 154 t. (including <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,25)\">Ezek 40:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:29\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,29)\">Ezek 40:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:33\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,33)\">Ezek 40:33</ref>, strike out <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>) + <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,12)\">Ezek 45:12</ref> (so read <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> for <bdbheb>חמּשׁה</bdbheb>); suffix <bdbheb>חֲמִשֶּׁיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,10)\">2Kgs 1:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,12)\">2Kgs 1:12</ref>, <bdbheb>חֲמִשָּׁיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,9)\">2Kgs 1:9</ref> + 4 t., <bdbheb>חֲמִשֵּׁיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,14)\">2Kgs 1:14</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> absolute <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>a fifty</highlight>, a company of fifty <ref ref=\"Exod 18:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,21)\">Exod 18:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 18:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,25)\">Exod 18:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 1:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,15)\">Deut 1:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 8:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,8,12)\">1Sam 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,9)\">2Kgs 1:9</ref> (twice in verse) + 13 t. <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,1)\">2Kgs 1</ref> (in v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,14)\">2Kgs 1:14</ref> = <highlight>fifties</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Isa 3:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,3)\">Isa 3:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> elsewhere, without noun expressed, (1) without other numeral <ref ref=\"Num 31:30\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,30)\">Num 31:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:47\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,47)\">Num 31:47</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,18)\">Ezek 27:18</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Hag 2:16\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,16)\">Hag 2:16</ref> (2) with other number <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> preceding <ref ref=\"Exod 30:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,23)\">Exod 30:23</ref> (twice in verse) + 11 t.; + <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:34\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,34)\">1Chr 12:34</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:33\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,33)\">1Chr 12:33</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>אלף</bdbheb>); (3) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> following <ref ref=\"Exod 38:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,26)\">Exod 38:26</ref> + 10 t.; (4) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> between other number <ref ref=\"Num 1:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,23)\">Num 1:23</ref> + 23 t. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>חֲמִשִּׁים</bdbheb> without other number: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> before noun <ref ref=\"Gen 6:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,6,15)\">Gen 6:15</ref> + 58 t. + <bdbheb>בָּאַמָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 38:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,12)\">Exod 38:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> after noun <ref ref=\"2Sam 24:24\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(10,24,24)\">2Sam 24:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 26:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,11)\">Exod 26:11</ref> + 4 t. Chronicles </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> before other numbers: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> followed by noun <ref ref=\"Gen 7:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,24)\">Gen 7:24</ref> +. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> preceded by noun <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,21)\">1Chr 5:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> after other number, and <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> this after noun <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:40\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,40)\">1Chr 8:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:3\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,3)\">Ezra 8:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:26\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,26)\">Ezra 8:26</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> noun repeated e.g. <ref ref=\"Gen 9:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,28)\">Gen 9:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 9:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,29)\">Gen 9:29</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> preceded by construct e.g. <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,23)\">2Kgs 15:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:27\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,27)\">2Kgs 15:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 15:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,15,10)\">Lev 15:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 15:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,15,11)\">Lev 15:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> = ordinal, <highlight>fiftieth</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,10)\">Lev 25:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 25:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,11)\">Lev 25:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,23)\">2Kgs 15:23</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:27\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,27)\">2Kgs 15:27</ref>. </p></div><hr>", 